    'historical/geographic interpretation from the distribution. Good chronology: events',
    'and dates in a table; the candidate identifies a sequence or an interval.',
    '',
    'VISUAL TYPE SELECTION',
    'Choose the type that fits the reasoning (table, chart, map_overlay, geometry, venn,',
